  "prefLabel": "Fors 302.04 References Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fors 302.04 References Required. Each applicant for licensure shall provide the OPLC with the names, addresses, e-mail addresses, and phone numbers of not fewer than 5 individuals, as references, not related to the applicant, of whom 3 or more shall be individuals having personal or professional knowledge of the applicant's forestry experience and 2 of these being foresters as defined by RSA 310-A:99, and one forester reference shall be an individual not connected with the applicant’s current place of employment.\n\nSource. #6876, eff 10-28-98; ss by #8710, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10544, eff 3-13-14; ss by #14085, eff 11-24-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fors100-500.html"
